on.py\", line 1035, in check_array\r\n    array = _asarray_with_order(array, order=order, dtype=dtype, xp=xp)\r\n            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\r\n  File \"/usr/local/lib/python3.12/site-packages/sklearn/utils/_array_api.py\", l"]
